  "description": "French Avenue Liquid Brun Limited Edition is a rich, warm vanilla-amber fragrance designed for bold presence and luxurious depth. This limited edition intensifies the signature Liquid Brun DNA with smoother sweetness, deeper woods, and powerful extrait concentration. The opening delivers a warm aromatic blend of lavender, citrus, and cardamom, creating a spicy freshness that feels refined and attention-grabbing. The heart develops into orange blossom, guaiac wood, and soft rose, adding floral elegance with woody warmth. The base settles into creamy vanilla, amber, tonka bean, and oakmoss, producing a smooth, sweet, and long-lasting trail that feels warm, addictive, and sophisticated. Liquid Brun Limited Edition is ideal for cooler weather, evening wear, and anyone who enjoys powerful gourmand-amber fragrances with a luxurious, modern character.",
